<metadata><name>Galičica trail T-3</name><desc>T-3 is one of Galičica National Park's harder and longer hiking trails, with more climbing. It runs 4.0 km from Velestovo to the MTB-3 junction, climbing about 482 m and descending 81 m in the direction drawn, between 1,072 m and 1,555 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/t-3/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
